Z||000000||firstfiero||12-12-2000||03:50 PM||||Do you guys find that all the kids driving their little japanese cars actually because they put a big exhaust and rims on their car that they can out run us? It drives me crazy when these kids pull up in their civics or preludes or worse yet those new celicas and think because their car is loud it must be fast? I think it's because our cars get no respect...if one more guy warns me about fiero engine fires I'm going to run over him?     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   ||||reg||8
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||12-12-2000||05:04 PM||||Civics, yes... Preludes and Celicas are pretty cool though, and it's a shame to see them riced up..<P>but yeah, I hate riced up Civics.. and well, I just plain hate CRXs.. heh.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||8
