Z||000014||stimpy||12-13-2000||11:21 AM||||I agree with the count on this, around here I get more interest in my car from import owners then sometimes other Fiero owners. I hve had stickered Nissan Sentras follow me into parking lots to ask about my car and have me pop the hood.  Most Fiero owners I can't even get to make eye contact. Driving a Civic doesn't make you evil. Just slow.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000015||firstfiero||12-13-2000||11:23 AM||||   When I had a porshe in my younger days we always blinked our head lights at eash other to kinda say hi. Test driving my fiero I had a guy do the same to me but that was a first and last.     Todd R||||reg||1
